# =============================================================================
# .prettierignore — adaptive-liquidity
# Prettier only touches MD / JSON / YAML / CSS / HTML / JS here. Keep it away
# from generated files and from the Overleaf-synced paper folder. Root Markdown
# notes (CLAUDE.md, reference-outlines.md) are intentionally left formattable.
# =============================================================================

# --- Overleaf-synced paper folder --------------------------------------------
# Don't let Prettier reformat anything in here (incl. .overleaf/settings.json
# and any JSON/MD), so it never fights the Overleaf sync.
paper/

# Artifacts
references/

# --- Dependencies / environments ---------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Build outputs / caches --------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
out/
cache/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- ML experiment tracking --------------------------------------------------
mlruns/
mlartifacts/
mlflow.db

# --- Solidity ----------------------------------------------------------------
# `forge fmt` owns .sol, not Prettier. The old .prettierrc named a "slang"
# parser that ships with prettier-plugin-solidity, which was never installed
# here -- it came from adaptive-liquidity, which (see the header above) kept
# Prettier away from Solidity too. It stayed quiet until contracts/ existed and
# then broke `npm run format` outright.
*.sol
lib/

# --- Research data / results (don't reformat data files) ---------------------
research/data/
research/results/
research/runs/
research/ETH_1hour/

# --- LaTeX build artifacts (Prettier skips these anyway; explicit is fine) ----
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls

# --- Generated JSON -----------------------------------------------------------
# Written by calibrate_gas / the golden fixture writer with indent=2, while the
# .prettierrc JSON override asks for 4. Left formattable, each regeneration and
# each `npm run format` would undo the other forever.
experiments/gas_estimates.json
tests/golden/

# --- Lockfiles / generated ----------------------------------------------------
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock

# --- Binaries (Prettier ignores, listed for clarity) -------------------------
*.pdf
*.png
